Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.59,0:00:04.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's to us, the Moonlit Black\NCats! Cheers, everyone! Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.59,0:00:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got another!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.79,0:00:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's to the guy who saved\Nour lives, Kirito! Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.95,0:00:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, cheers, guys. Thanks.\NYeah, man. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.79,0:00:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved us back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.83,0:00:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.47,0:00:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how scared I was,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.75,0:00:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it made me so happy when\Nyou came to save us, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.91,0:00:29.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, uh, Kirito, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I'm not out of line asking this,\Nbut I was wondering what level you're at.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:36.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Level 20?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're at our level and\Nstill a solo player?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.59,0:00:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're an inspiration, sir! Cait,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.99,0:00:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not your superior,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.37,0:00:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and being solo means I'm always\Nhunting enemies out in the boonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.07,0:00:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not very efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.63,0:00:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.37,0:00:52.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.95,0:00:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate to spring this on you here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.51,0:00:57.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you want, we'd love\Nto have you in our guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our mace wielder, Tetsuo, is the only\None we can put out front right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.37,0:01:04.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then we've got Sachi over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:06.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was thinking of having her\Nswitch to sword and shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.83,0:01:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way, she can fight\Non the front lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.21,0:01:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thing is, she says she's\Nnot sure she can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.15,0:01:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you join us, maybe you\Ncould teach her a thing or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not that useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, you can't just put me up\Nfront and expect me to know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.27,0:01:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be terrified.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.63,0:01:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:25.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just hide behind your shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.81,0:01:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.72,0:01:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since I can remember,\Nyou've always been a Sigurd cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.51,0:01:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We always joke around like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.73,0:01:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, in real life,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we all go to the same high school\Nand are members of the computer club.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.11,0:01:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you're worried about\Nfitting in with us, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.53,0:01:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as I'm concerned, you're\Nalready part of our group.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.25,0:01:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.95,0:01:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm really flattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.03,0:01:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thanks for the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
