Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.77,0:04:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congrats, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You totally owned that sucker!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The assault team made\Nit through to floor 28.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.92,0:04:17.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1089,243)\fnDroid Sans\b1\fs75\blur1.5\fscx500\fscy250\fsp-15\c&HCFB3A4&\frz342.4\clip(m 774 39 l 747 109.5 b 957 153 1299 255 1489.5 325.5 l 1513.5 258 b 1330.5 189 978 79.5 775.5 40.5)}l{\c&HCDB1A4&}l{\c&HCCB1A4&}l{\c&HCBB0A3&}l{\c&HC9B0A3&}l{\c&HC8AFA2&}l{\c&HC7AFA2&}l{\c&HC5AEA1&}l{\c&HC4AEA1&}l{\c&HC3ADA0&}l{\c&HC1ADA0&}l{\c&HC0AC9F&}l{\c&HBFAC9F&}l{\c&HBDAB9E&}l{\c&HBCAB9E&}l{\c&HBBAB9E&}l{\c&HB9AA9D&}l{\c&HB8AA9D&}l{\c&HB7A99C&}l{\c&HB5A89C&}l{\c&HB4A79B&}l{\c&HB3A79B&}l{\c&HB0A59A&}l{\c&HAEA59A&}l{\c&HADA499&}l{\c&HABA499&}l{\c&HAAA398&}l{\c&HA9A398&}l{\c&HA7A297&}l{\c&HA6A297&}l{\c&HA5A297&}llllllll
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.92,0:04:17.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\org(1074,227)\pos(1120.5,157.5)\blur1.2\fax-0.1\fs42\fnDroid Sans\b1\c&H975F4A&\frz346}The {\frz345.5\fax-0.09\c&H8C5343&}Clea{\frz345\c&H874E3E&}ring {\frz344.5\fax-0.08\c&H754237&}Group {\frz344\fax-0.07\c&H694439&}Pas{\frz343.5\c&H5B362B&}ses {\fax-0.06\frz343\c&H4F3529&}the {\frz342.5\c&H4E3725&}28th {\frz342}Floor!
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.92,0:04:17.96,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1245,241.5)\fax-0.1\b1\fs37.5\blur1.2\c&H4D3327&\frz344}—Zero {\frz343.5}Cas{\frz343}ual{\frz342.5}ties, {\frz342}Yet {\frz341.5}Again—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.31,0:04:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey Kirito, what the heck does the\Nassault team have that we don't? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,access to information—with\Nthat they can find out the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.21,0:04:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,easiest ways to get XP—and\Nthey don't share that info.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're probably\Nright, but I think what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.51,0:04:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think what really sets\Nthem apart is willpower.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.13,0:04:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.31,0:04:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess what I mean is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.77,0:04:44.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have the will to\Nstick up for their friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.75,0:04:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or any player for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth is, I like to think we\Nhave that same kind of drive,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.21,0:04:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even though we still\Nneed their protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, our first priority\Nis looking out for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.35,0:05:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But someday, if we get strong enough,\Nwe'll join the elites in the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.57,0:05:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:03.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.63,0:05:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, leader, give me some love!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you really think we can\Nbe as strong as the Holy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dragon Alliance or the\NKnights of the Blood Oath?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, what if I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.07,0:05:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing wrong with setting our sights\Nhigh, but we have to be level 30 first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.07,0:05:23.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like the way Cait thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.87,0:05:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Black Cats can level up\Nfast and get to the front lines,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.23,0:05:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his ideals could change the elitist\Nattitude of the assault team.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.47,0:05:38.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have an announcement to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.77,0:05:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After our latest hunts in the\Nfield, we've got 200,000 coal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:45.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Buying a house of our own doesn't\Nseem like such a pipe dream anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.73,0:05:49.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should upgrade Sachi's equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.41,0:05:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.65,0:05:55.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with what I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:56.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.07,0:06:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, it's not fair to make\NKirito be out in front forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.47,0:06:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.57,0:06:05.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm cool with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:06.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sachi, I know switching jobs isn't easy,\Nbut seriously, you're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, I know it!
