Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.13,0:06:26.88,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1045.001,942)\fad(500,500)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF5F5F5&}May {\fscx110}16{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2023{\fscx95}    {\fscx110}28{\fscx95}th Floor • Wolf Plains
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:34.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klein.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.59,0:06:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The trash mob's all yours, guys. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.43,0:06:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, it's been a while\Nsince I've seen you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.87,0:06:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, you doing some late-night\Nleveling or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.37,0:07:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up with that icon?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you join a guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.07,0:07:07.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can move on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.17,0:07:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.63,0:07:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.25,0:07:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it still bugging you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.25,0:07:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Cait.
