Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sachi went off somewhere\Nand hasn't come back yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:32.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're heading to the dungeon now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.39,0:07:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please let me know if\Nyou find anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sachi…
