Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.77,0:07:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sachi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.81,0:08:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.72,0:08:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.49,0:08:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kirito. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.09,0:08:19.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.33,0:08:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the moonlit black cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.99,0:08:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And from Sword Art Online, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you talking about suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.31,0:08:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not such a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.31,0:08:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.51,0:08:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I had the guts to die, I wouldn't be\Nhiding in town where it's safe, would I?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.67,0:08:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But really, why can't we just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.87,0:08:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do we have to die when\Nit's just a stupid game?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.87,0:08:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the point of going through this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.43,0:08:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there is no point, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.55,0:09:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so afraid of dying. In here,\Nit's really that bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.87,0:09:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm so scared i haven't been\Nable to get any sleep lately
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not going to die\Nreally how can you be so
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure about that the black\Ncats are strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as a guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.98,0:09:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, our margin of safety\Nis well above the norm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.81,0:09:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, you got Tetsuo and me up front,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so there's no reason to be\Non the frontlines with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You honestly don't think I'll die?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.01,0:09:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will I make it back to the real world?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.75,0:09:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're not gonna die. You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.47,0:09:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll clear this game and go home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't seem to get to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.45,0:10:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I stay in this guild,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she'll be safe, and we'll all make\Nit back to the real world someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be a lot of players like\Nher who are afraid of dying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, they laugh and cry\Nand try to live as best they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:30.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought about it like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.55,0:10:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:34.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you're going to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And no matter what, I promise\NI'll protect all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.15,0:10:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm heading out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.23,0:10:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleport!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.14,0:10:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Town of Beginnings!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.73,0:10:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.05,0:11:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought buying a\Nhouse would be so exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.81,0:11:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, you sound like an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.13,0:11:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while Kato's off buying the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what do you guys say we go\Nout and raise some extra cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.11,0:11:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, then we can buy furniture!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.19,0:11:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go to a\Ndungeon on a higher floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.17,0:11:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should stick to our\Nusual hunting spots.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.91,0:11:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But up there, we could\Nmake more and faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.49,0:11:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and at our levels, we don't\Nhave anything to worry about.
