Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.47,0:11:30.73,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1014,942)\fad(550,550)\fsp-1.5\fscx95\fscy85\shad0\blur0.45\fs72\c&HF2F2F2&}June {\fscx110}12{\fscx95}th, {\fscx110}2023{\fscx95}   {\fscx110}27{\fscx95}th Floor • Labyrinth
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.29,0:11:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you guys this was going to be cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.57,0:11:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might even be able to\Nreach the front line sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.53,0:11:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.55,0:11:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.65,0:11:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hidden door?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.57,0:11:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A treasure chest! Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.41,0:11:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a trap, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.11,0:12:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.11,0:12:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.41,0:12:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleport theft!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.57,0:12:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Teleport theft!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.99,0:12:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't use our crystals!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're probably being\Nblocked by the walls
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.33,0:12:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.23,0:12:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stacia!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.95,0:13:00.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stacia!
