Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear someone's been taking\Nrisks with their level raising.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.43,0:13:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got any new info for me or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.35,0:13:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing worth charging you money for.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.93,0:13:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You give info brokers a bad name.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this wasn't in the beta test.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.41,0:13:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a first-time event.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.47,0:13:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to\Nknow what's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I know is that tonight on Christmas\NEve, the event boss is gonna appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:56.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's called Nicholas the Renegade,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.03,0:13:59.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he's gonna show up\Nunder a fir tree somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.29,0:14:04.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The major guilds are searching\Neverywhere for the tree as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.19,0:14:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to know\Nwhere it is, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.99,0:14:09.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.07,0:14:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you thinking of\Ngoing solo on this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.61,0:14:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this world, the dead\Ncan never return to life.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.65,0:14:23.11,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.9\fnChampagne & Limousines\fs36\frz349.7\fay-0.02\c&H4ECDFF&\bord0.15\3c&H4ECDFF&\pos(556.5,344)}Equipped
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.45,0:14:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard a rumor, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.67,0:14:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you beat Nicholas the Renegade, he'll\Ndrop an item that can revive a dead player.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.19,0:14:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going alone, and\NI'll probably die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.45,0:14:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will see me, no one will know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing will be left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a beater.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.09,0:14:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had no right to be with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.89,0:15:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.69,0:15:04.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arrogance killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.03,0:15:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.77,0:15:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I hadn't kept my true level\Nas a player secret from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.65,0:15:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to figure out a\Nway to beat Nicholas.
