Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I can revive Sachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then I'll find out what\Nshe was trying to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it turns out she\Nwas cursing me, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.09,0:15:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.35,0:15:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.55,0:15:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You followed me? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're after the revival item, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.81,0:15:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't risk your life for some rumor\Nthat could turn out to be bogus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:16:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, you can't be messing\Naround in this death game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:03.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once your HP hits zero, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.43,0:16:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the real world, your\Nbrain gets fried and it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.01,0:16:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to get you to stop\Nwith all your stupid soloing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.13,0:16:11.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, join up with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.03,0:16:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever gets it to drop\Nthe revival item keeps it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No hard feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.59,0:16:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's fair, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.67,0:16:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, there'd be no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to do this. Alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.77,0:16:26.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about what you're doing, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.73,0:16:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's suicide, and I can't\Nlet you die like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.31,0:16:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.07,0:16:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you were being followed,\Ntoo, huh, Klein? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.95,0:16:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Holy Dragon Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.23,0:16:45.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll do anything for a rare\Nitem, no matter how shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.63,0:16:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.47,0:16:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screw these guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, Kirito! No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.63,0:16:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave them to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:16:58.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.85,0:17:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.73,0:18:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.65,0:18:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, that's the revival item.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.91,0:18:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see; it says: "must\NAdministrator to affected player
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.39,0:18:22.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(528,463.5)\fs27\bord0.3\3c&H94887F&\blur0.9\alpha&H33&\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H9B958C&\fry4\frx-4\frz13.75}After a player dies but before the light effects
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.39,0:18:22.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(535.5,510)\fs27\bord0.3\3c&H94887F&\blur0.9\alpha&H33&\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H9B958C&\fry4\frx-4\frz13.75}completely disappear (within ten seconds),
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.39,0:18:22.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(546,552.75)\fs27\bord0.3\3c&H94887F&\blur0.9\alpha&H33&\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H9B958C&\fry4\frx-4\frz13.75}you can revive the player by selecting this item
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.39,0:18:22.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(552,598.5)\fs27\bord0.3\3c&H94887F&\blur0.9\alpha&H33&\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H9B958C&\fry4\frx-4\frz14.1}from the pop-up menu, or by holding it in your
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.39,0:18:22.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(561,647.25)\fs27\bord0.3\3c&H94887F&\blur0.9\alpha&H33&\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H9B958C&\fry4\frx-4\frz14.7}hand and saying "Rebirth" followed by
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.39,0:18:22.89,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(570,690.75)\fs27\bord0.3\3c&H94887F&\blur0.9\alpha&H33&\fnChampagne & Limousines\c&H9B958C&\fry4\frx-4\frz14.5}the player's name.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.89,0:18:23.85,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(996.75,351)\fax-0.07\fs180\fnChampagne & Limousines\blur1.05\c&HD9D0C5&\frz13.14}(within 10 seconds)
Dialogue: 2,0:18:22.89,0:18:23.85,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\pos(996,346.5)\fs180\fax-0.07\fnChampagne & Limousines\blur1.05\c&H827263&\frz13.14}(within 10 seconds)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.63,0:18:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,within 10 seconds." If someone dies in\Nfront of you someday, make sure you use it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito! Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay alive, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.53,0:18:48.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care how you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay alive to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.53,0:18:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.43,0:19:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saatchi…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.39,0:19:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas, Kirito.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.55,0:19:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the time you hear this,\NI'll probably be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.85,0:19:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I explain this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.03,0:19:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.77,0:19:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell you the truth, I never really\Nwanted to leave the town of beginnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.49,0:19:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I knew if I fought with an attitude\Nlike that, I would end up dying someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.11,0:19:57.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not anyone's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.25,0:20:00.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's something I have to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.43,0:20:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, ever since that\Nnight you found me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you kept telling me I wasn't\Ngoing to die no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if I got killed anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.53,0:20:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew that if I died,\Nyou'd blame yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.27,0:20:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I decided\Nto record this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:22.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I know how\Npowerful you really are. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:24.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sort of peaked when you weren't looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.81,0:20:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wondered why you\Nweren't telling the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.81,0:20:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about what level player you really were.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.05,0:20:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wondered why you\Ndecided to fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.73,0:20:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never figured it out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.87,0:20:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I found out how strong you were,\NI don't know, it made me so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.01,0:20:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.33,0:20:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So even if I die, promise me\Nyou'll go on living, okay, Kirito?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.65,0:20:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay alive, so you can see the end of this\Nworld and find out why it was created.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.41,0:20:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out why a weakling\Nlike me ended up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find out the reason you and I met.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.63,0:21:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.51,0:21:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.33,0:21:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I still have time, so seeing\Nhow it's Christmas and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll sing you a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Kirito, I'm so glad I met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.93,0:21:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that I could be with\Nyou, even for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.23,0:21:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, goodbye.
